   "heading": "Four key irregular verbs",
   "body": "These four are among the most used verbs in French. Learn them by heart:\n\nWatch the pronunciation: *faisons* is said /fə.zɔ̃/; *ils prennent* /pʁɛn/ but *il prend* /pʁɑ̃/.",
